; reg --gain --average-lot-prices prints the same report on every run, and
; its averaged totals print with the precision reg --gain gives them
; without averaging (see reg-gain-merged-precision.test, which explains
; the --gain figures of these two journals).
;
; --average-lot-prices shows each commodity's lots as one lot: it adds up
; their quantities, and their prices times their quantities, and divides
; the second sum by the first.  A price without a commodity, such as {5}
; or the PLN prices that the C directive makes plain numbers, takes the
; lot's commodity, so 100.00 EUR {5} shows as {5.00 EUR}.  After the cash
; payment the first journal's --gain total holds that lot and 33.3333 EUR,
; a cost kept at full precision, with no price: one lot of 133.3333 EUR at
; 500.00 EUR / 133.3333 EUR = 3.750000937500234375058594 EUR.  Adding two
; amounts used to keep only the left one's full-precision flag, so the
; order the lots were added in decided how their sum printed: Ledger added
; them in the order its balances kept them, which put the lot first in
; both journals, so the total printed as 133.33 EUR, and the second
; journal's third exchange as 600,00 GBP after an <Adjustment> of
; 0,00022644 GBP.  A sum now keeps full precision when either part has it,
; whatever the order: 133.3333 EUR and 599,99977356 GBP, as reg --gain
; prints them.
;
; The register adds an <Adjustment> wherever the displayed total less the
; posting's amount differs from the last total.  Averaging can make them
; differ in lot prices alone, which averages to nothing and prints as 0;
; the 0,00045288 GBP one is a rounding: 799,99954712 GBP prints as
; 800,00 GBP.  --lot-dates shows that an averaged lot keeps its earliest
; date.  -p picks one journal per block, and each block runs Ledger
; afresh.

2024/01/01 Buy euros
    Assets:Euros          100.00 EUR @ 5
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/02 Pay cash
    Assets:Cash             -100 @ 0.333333 EUR
    Assets:Euros           33.33 EUR

; The journal of 1E192DF6.test, with a neutral payee.
D 1000,00 PLN
N $
N h
N PLN
N zł
C 1,00 PLN = 1,00

2010-05-19 * Currency exchange
    Assets:Checking:Konto24 GBP               200,00 GBP @ 4,8799 PLN  ; fikimiki
    Assets:Checking:Konto<30                 -975,98 PLN

2010-05-19 * Currency exchange
    Assets:Checking:Konto24 GBP               200,00 GBP @ 4,8799 PLN  ; fikimiki
    Assets:Checking:Konto<30                 -975,98 PLN

2010-05-19 * Currency exchange
   Assets:Checking:Konto<30                 -975,98 PLN @ 0,204922 GBP
   Assets:Checking:Konto24 GBP               200,00 GBP ; fikimiki

2010-05-19 * Currency exchange
   Assets:Checking:Konto<30                 -975,98 PLN @ 0,204922 GBP
   Assets:Checking:Konto24 GBP               200,00 GBP ; fikimiki

2010-05-19 * Currency exchange
   Assets:Checking:Konto24 GBP               200,00 GBP @ 4,8799 PLN  ; fikimiki
   Assets:Checking:Konto<30                 -975,98 PLN

2010-05-19 * Currency exchange
   Assets:Checking:Konto24 GBP               200,00 GBP @ 4,8799 PLN  ; fikimiki
   Assets:Checking:Konto<30                 -975,98 PLN

test reg --gain --average-lot-prices -p 2024
24-Jan-01 Buy euros             Assets:Euros                   -500
                                              100.00 EUR {5.00 EUR}         -500
                                                           100.00 EUR {5.00 EUR}
24-Jan-02 Pay cash              <Adjustment>                      0         -500
                                                           100.00 EUR {5.00 EUR}
                                Assets:Cash                    -100
                                                        33.3333 EUR         -600
                                   133.3333 EUR {3.750000937500234375058594 EUR}
end test

